                "quoted_status_profile_username": "KRCR7",
                "reply_count": 25,
                "retweet_count": 29,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Starting July 1, California will charge $5 every time you buy ammunition. That\u2019s up from the current $1 fee.\n\nThis is outrageous. You don\u2019t have to pay a tax to exercise any of your other constitutionally guaranteed rights\u2014voting, jury trial, speech, religion, cruel and unusual punishment, etc. We shouldn\u2019t have to pay a tax to exercise our Second Amendment rights either.\n\nCalifornia\u2019s leaders are once again trying to price law-abiding gun owners out of their rights while doing nothing to stop actual crime.\n\nWe need to stop treating the Constitution like a suggestion. This looks like the next, in a long list of California gun laws that need to be struck down. I\u2019ll be sure the Trump Administration's Civil Rights Division of the Department of Justice is aware and fighting back.",
                "text_lang": "en",
